  "name": "Lion Pursuit",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>You don’t let up during your trigger attacks, able to reload your gunarm with ease.</em></p><p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Dex 17, Proficiency with a trigger attack gunarm, Lion Style, Lion Claws, base attack bonus +9.</p><p>BENEFIT</p><p>Once per round while in Lion Style, you may reload your gunarm in the middle of a full attack action as a swift action.</p><p><strong>Special:</strong> If you have Rapid Reload or can normally reload your gunarm as a swift action, you may reload your gunarm using this feat as a free action.</p>",
